{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“小平嵌入定理”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"小平嵌入定理"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>若 $(M,L)$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"极化流形","text":"极化流形"}},{"Plain":", 则存在足够大的正整数 $k_0$, 使得对 $k\\geq k_0$, 如下映射是嵌入: 令 $N = \\dim H^0(M,L^k)$, 任取 $L^k$ 的全纯截面 $s_0,\\cdots,s_N$, 定义\n$$\r\n\\Phi_{L^k}\\colon M\\to \\mathbb P^N(\\mathbb{C}),p\\mapsto (s_0(p):\\cdots: s_N(p)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>. 若 $M$ 上存在"},{"Local":{"url":"正线丛","text":"正线丛"}},{"Plain":", 则 $M$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"代数簇","text":"代数簇"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}